","Gwynyth Walsh","Darcey Johnson","Dean McKenzie","Rachel Nichols","Charlie Hofheimer","Nicole Oliver","Douglas Chapman","Colin Corrigan","Barbara Eve Harris","Kwesi Ameyaw","Blaine Anderson","Timothy V. Murphy","Aubrey Deeker Hernandez","Jillian Walchuck","Carolyn Yonge","Robyn Bradley","Heather-Claire Nortey","Adam Henderson","Forbes Angus","Ray Proscia","Francisco Trujillo","Giles Panton","Lauren Maynard","Jaren Moore","James Neate","Lauchlin MacDonald","Jarrod Evanyshyn","Kheon Clarke","Blair Penner","Ken Lawson","Cody Ray Thompson","Destiny Millns","Maggie Ma","Andres Soto","Sean Kuling","Alexander J. Baxter","Marlie Collins","John Shaw","Brian Cyburt","Trevor Carroll","Corina Akeson","Eric Breker","William Belleau","John Hans Tester","Dean Paul Gibson","Kesler Talbot","Bob Frazer","Ari Solomon","Shannon Day","Pavel Romano","Monique Phillips","Abie Ekenezar","Harry Han","Javier Lacroix","Kai Bradbury","Janet Glassford","Eric Mazimpaka","Cara Mitsuko","Christina Schell","John Mariano","Ruairi MacDonald","Shane Dean","Neuman Jody Mannas"],"screenwriters":["Frank Spotnitz","Walon Green","Emma Frost","Thomas Schnauz","Wesley Strick","Francesca Gardiner","Rick Cleveland","Evan Wright","Eric Ellis Overmyer","Eric Simonson","Elizabeth Benjamin","Erik Oleson","William N. Fordes","Chris Collins","Chris Wu","Jace Richdale","Mark Richard","Julie Hébert","David Scarpa","Jihan Crowther","Rob Williams"],"cinematographers":["James Hawkinson","Gonzalo Amat"],"composers":["Henry Jackman","Dominic Lewis"],"reviews":[{"author":"Spooner","text":"Pilot:Amazon válí a v podobě alternativní reality nám servíruje nesmírně poutavý a lákavý svět, zajímavé postavy a příslib nabušené podívané, která dokáže zaujmout ve všech dějových linkách.  Režii se daří budovat tu správnou šedesátkovou atmosféru s fungujícím ponurým vizuálem a štědrou výpravou. Celý pilot pak srší takovými nápady a potenciál, že odklepnout celou řadu byla v tomto případě vlastně povinnost.80%(21.02.2015)","stars":5},{"author":"Davies182","text":"Pilot:Jo, tak takhle by to šlo. Kdy se v bedně naposledy ukázalo cokoliv, co by disponovalo tak dechberoucí dobovou (fiktivní!) atmosférou, hm? Nepamatuji se... možná Mob City. Až na to, že mě naštval ten podivný (bojím se říci nedomyšlený) twist ve finále, tak spokojenost. Dickovi věřim, tvůrcům už míň. Ale až natočej zbytek, určitě u toho budu...(18.03.2015)","stars":4},{"author":"3 AM Code","text":"Adaptace stejnojmené novely Philipa K. Dicka do pilota k potencionalnimu serialu. Vypada to dost dobre, herecky velice sympaticke a Dickovi Sci-Fi zatim temer nikdy nesklamali (Blade Runner,Total Recall,Minority Report,Paycheck,Scanner Darkly..) Doufam ze se do toho Amazon obuje a daji zelenou serialu, nemuzou prece vsechnu smetanu nechat HBO. :)(20.01.2015)","stars":4}],"vods":[{"platform":"Prime Video","url":"https://www.primevideo.com/detail/amzn1.dv.gti.0eaaa1cc-ec7a-74e5-6229-de0d8d683216"},{"platform":"Canal+","url":"https://www.canalplus.cz/stream/series/muz-z-vysokeho-zamku/?utm_campaign=vod_content&utm_content=feed&utm_source=csfd&utm_medium=partner&utm_term="}],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/403167-muz-z-vysokeho-zamku/prehled/","root_id":403167,"root_title_id":null,"is_toplevel":true,"season_no":null,"episode_no":null,"season_count":4,"episode_count":40,"is_running":false,"cadence_days":null,"first_vod_date":"2015-01-15","last_vod_date":"2015-01-15","episodes":[{"season_no":1,"episode_no":1,"vod_date":"2015-01-15","title":"Nový svět","platforms":["Prime Video","Canal+"]}]}